 "text": "Hi, how you doing right now? Let's get going. We can stop at the shop across the street and pick up tent stakes if you worry too. Then we' set. I' lead, watch out for the potholes, and keep the speed up. Not really, our lead dog knows what it' doing in strong winds. We' stop and take a break if it gets too wild. He' laugh at you, not at you. tent stakes are small and easy to miss in the dark. Then act surprised every time you find one. It' a classic gag.",
